---
---

<section id="top" class="hero">
  <div class="container grid">
    <div class="copy">
      <h1>Rutas y zonas de entrega <span class="accent">seguras</span> en tiempo real para domiciliarios en Bogotá.</h1>

      <p class="lede">
        Mira el riesgo de cada barrio antes de aceptar el pedido, recibe alertas antes de entrar a una zona caliente y llega con una ruta alterna lista.
      </p>

      <a href="#registro" class="primary-cta">
        Registrarme gratis
        <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
          <path
            d="M4 12h15m0 0-6-6m6 6-6 6"
            stroke="#fff"
            stroke-width="2.4"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
        </svg>
      </a>

      <div class="trust-row">
        <span class="trust-pill">
          <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" style="color: var(--color-success)">
            <path
              d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="3"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
          </svg>
          Gratis para domiciliarios
        </span>
        <span class="trust-pill">
          <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" style="color: var(--color-success)">
            <path
              d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="3"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
          </svg>
          Consume pocos datos
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mockup-wrap">
      <div class="mockup">
        <div class="glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="phone">
          <div class="screen">
            <div class="grid-lines" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="streets" aria-hidden="true"></div>

            <div class="zone zone-danger" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="zone zone-warning" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="zone zone-safe" aria-hidden="true"></div>

            <div class="pin pin-danger" aria-hidden="true">
              <span class="pin-ping"></span>
            </div>
            <div class="pin pin-warning" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="pin pin-safe" aria-hidden="true"></div>

            <div class="route-card">
              <span>Kennedy → P. Aranda</span>
              <span class="eta">18 min</span>
            </div>

            <div class="alert-card">
              <div class="alert-title">
                <span class="alert-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                Riesgo alto adelante
              </div>
              <p>3 hurtos reportados hoy sobre la Cl. 13. Desvía por la Av. Américas.</p>
              <div class="alert-action">Usar ruta segura</div>
            </div>

            <div class="legend">
              <span class="legend-item legend-safe">Segura</span>
              <span class="legend-item legend-warning">Precaución</span>
              <span class="legend-item legend-danger">Peligro</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    padding: 34px 0 54px;
  }

  .grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 40px;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(330px, 100%), 1fr));
    align-items: center;
  }

  .copy {
    display: grid;
    gap: 22px;
    justify-items: start;
  }

  h1 {
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: clamp(34px, 8.6vw, 60px);
    line-height: 1.04;
    letter-spacing: -2px;
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 17ch;
  }

  .accent {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .lede {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(17px, 4.4vw, 20px);
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    max-width: 46ch;
  }

  .primary-cta {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 400px;
    background: var(--color-accent);
    color: #fff;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: clamp(19px, 5vw, 23px);
    letter-spacing: -0.3px;
    padding: 22px 30px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    min-height: 68px;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 12px;
    box-shadow: 0 18px 38px rgba(234, 88, 12, 0.4);
  }

  .primary-cta:hover {
    background: var(--color-accent-dark);
    color: #fff;
    box-shadow: 0 22px 46px rgba(234, 88, 12, 0.5);
  }

  .trust-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .trust-pill {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 7px;
    font-size: 14.5px;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    background: var(--color-surface-alt);
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 9px 15px;
  }

  .mockup-wrap {
    display: grid;
    justify-items: center;
  }

  .mockup {
    position: relative;
    width: min(330px, 84vw);
  }

  .glow {
    position: absolute;
    inset: -22px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(234, 88, 12, 0.22) 0%, rgba(234, 88, 12, 0.05) 55%, transparent 72%);
  }

  .phone {
    position: relative;
    aspect-ratio: 9 / 18.6;
    border-radius: 46px;
    background: var(--color-ink);
    padding: 10px;
    box-shadow: 0 30px 60px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.3);
  }

  .screen {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    border-radius: 37px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #16233b;
  }

  .grid-lines {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.22) 1.5px, transparent 1.5px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.22) 1.5px, transparent 1.5px);
    background-size: 44px 44px;
  }

  .streets {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background-image: linear-gradient(
        72deg,
        transparent 44%,
        rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.4) 44%,
        rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.4) 47.5%,
        transparent 47.5%
      ),
      linear-gradient(
        -54deg,
        transparent 63%,
        rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.28) 63%,
        rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.28) 66%,
        transparent 66%
      );
  }

  .zone {
    position: absolute;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }

  .zone-danger {
    width: 200px;
    height: 200px;
    left: -56px;
    top: 88px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.62) 0%, rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.24) 56%, transparent 72%);
  }

  .zone-warning {
    width: 158px;
    height: 158px;
    right: -38px;
    top: 232px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.56) 0%, rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.2) 56%, transparent 72%);
  }

  .zone-safe {
    width: 172px;
    height: 172px;
    left: 22px;
    bottom: 26px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.5) 0%, rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.18) 56%, transparent 72%);
  }

  .pin {
    position: absolute;
    width: 13px;
    height: 13px;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }

  .pin-danger {
    left: 104px;
    top: 146px;
    width: 15px;
    height: 15px;
    background: var(--color-danger);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.3);
  }

  .pin-ping {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--color-danger);
  }

  .pin-warning {
    right: 42px;
    top: 290px;
    background: var(--color-warning);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.28);
  }

  .pin-safe {
    left: 84px;
    bottom: 118px;
    background: var(--color-success);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.28);
  }

  .route-card {
    position: absolute;
    top: 14px;
    left: 12px;
    right: 12px;
    background: rgba(248, 250, 252, 0.96);
    border-radius: 18px;
    padding: 12px 14px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 10px;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(2, 6, 23, 0.28);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }

  .eta {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-danger-dark);
    background: var(--color-danger-bg);
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 5px 10px;
  }

  .alert-card {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 74px;
    left: 12px;
    right: 12px;
    background: #fff;
    border-radius: 22px;
    padding: 15px;
    box-shadow: 0 16px 32px rgba(2, 6, 23, 0.4);
  }

  .alert-title {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-danger-dark);
  }

  .alert-dot {
    width: 9px;
    height: 9px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--color-danger);
  }

  .alert-card p {
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .alert-action {
    background: var(--color-accent);
    color: #fff;
    text-align: center;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    padding: 12px;
    border-radius: 999px;
  }

  .legend {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 16px;
    left: 12px;
    right: 12px;
    display: flex;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  .legend-item {
    flex: 1;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 8px 4px;
  }

  .legend-safe {
    color: #6ee7b7;
    background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.16);
  }

  .legend-warning {
    color: #fde68a;
    background: rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.16);
  }

  .legend-danger {
    color: #fca5a5;
    background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.18);
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
    .phone {
      animation: float 7s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    .pin-ping {
      animation: ping 2.1s ease-out infinite;
    }
  }
</style>
